{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":2,"ref":"ezekiel 46:2","book":"ezekiel","lang":"de","chapter":46,"translation":"Und der Naschi kommt ⟨den⟩ Weg der Halle des Tors von außen, und ⟨er⟩ stellt sich an den Pfosten des Tors, und die Kohen sollen ⟨את⟩ sein Ola und ⟨את⟩ seine Schelamim bereiten, und ⟨er⟩ wirft sich nieder am Türpfosten des Tors, und ⟨er⟩ geht hinaus, und das Tor soll nicht geschlossen werden bis zum Abend.","tokens":[{"surface":"ובא","gloss":"Und ⟨er⟩ kommt"},{"surface":"הנשיא","gloss":"der Naschi"},{"surface":"דרך","gloss":"⟨den⟩ Weg"},{"surface":"אולם","gloss":"der Halle"},{"surface":"השער","gloss":"des Tors"},{"surface":"מחוץ","gloss":"von außen"},{"surface":"ועמד","gloss":"und ⟨er⟩ stellt sich"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"an"},{"surface":"מזוזת","gloss":"⟨den⟩ Pfosten"},{"surface":"השער","gloss":"des Tors"},{"surface":"ועשו","gloss":"und ⟨sie⟩ sollen bereiten"},{"surface":"הכהנים","gloss":"die Kohen"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"sein Ola"},{"surface":"עולתו","gloss":"sein Ola"},{"surface":"ואת","gloss":"und ⟨את⟩","marks":"seine Schelamim"},{"surface":"שלמיו","gloss":"seine Schelamim"},{"surface":"והשתחוה","gloss":"und ⟨er⟩ wirft sich nieder"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"am"},{"surface":"מפתן","gloss":"Türpfosten"},{"surface":"השער","gloss":"des Tors"},{"surface":"ויצא","gloss":"und ⟨er⟩ geht hinaus"},{"surface":"והשער","gloss":"und das Tor"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"nicht"},{"surface":"יסגר","gloss":"soll geschlossen werden"},{"surface":"עד","gloss":"bis"},{"surface":"הערב","gloss":"zum Abend"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-06T03:55:15.691704674Z","model":"glm-5.2"}